    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bd An action RPG where a miniature dachshund, after death, mows down nightmares to reunite with her owner!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t underestimate her just because she\u2019s a miniature dachshund!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily is actually really strong!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/39a1c07353e07504cf526bde3b3cabfa.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/39a1c07353e07504cf526bde3b3cabfa.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/39a1c07353e07504cf526bde3b3cabfa.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bd Because Lily died, her beloved Takeru fell into despair!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the afterlife realm <i>Yomi-no-Kuni</i>, she\u2019ll dive into Takeru\u2019s <i>Yume-Sekai</i> (Dream World) and blast away the nightmares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/fa192f850b3c125602d6881486c08384.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/fa192f850b3c125602d6881486c08384.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/fa192f850b3c125602d6881486c08384.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bd To save her owner consumed by nightmares, set off on an adventure in the <i>Yume-Sekai</i> with Lily!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny legs\uff0cbig skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/3f662b3c7208e05eeb65611409b81427.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/3f662b3c7208e05eeb65611409b81427.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/3f662b3c7208e05eeb65611409b81427.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bd Takeru\u2019s precious memories have been stolen by the Petlos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unforgivable\u2026! I\u2019ll take them back no matter what\u2026!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And\u2026 I hope I can see Takeru again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/2409cd8c85372ff05d603916e4c96c45.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/2409cd8c85372ff05d603916e4c96c45.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/2409cd8c85372ff05d603916e4c96c45.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bd A cute dog takes center stage in the world of <i>Yume-Sekai</i>, slashing through nightmares!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fierce battles against the Boss Petlos who stole the memories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/b2b4a136e71bd10a251a934d75fd3b1a.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/b2b4a136e71bd10a251a934d75fd3b1a.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/b2b4a136e71bd10a251a934d75fd3b1a.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/0adb473a89fe4dfe76abe0666ce674a8.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/0adb473a89fe4dfe76abe0666ce674a8.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/0adb473a89fe4dfe76abe0666ce674a8.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a heartfelt yet heartwarming canine action story with Lily, set in the slightly dark <i>Yume-Sekai</i> and the fantastical <i>Yomi-no-Kuni</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u25bd\u201cLily in DreamWorld\u201d</i> was selected for the 2025 <i>indie Game incubator (iGi)</i> program, hosted by Marvelous Inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/cb54c4150ed9d37d7a27c44db0c81cf6.avif?t=1755141935\" width=1207 height=964 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bd An action RPG where a miniature dachshund, after death, mows down nightmares to reunite with her owner!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t underestimate her just because she\u2019s a miniature dachshund!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily is actually really strong!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/39a1c07353e07504cf526bde3b3cabfa.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/39a1c07353e07504cf526bde3b3cabfa.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/39a1c07353e07504cf526bde3b3cabfa.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bd Because Lily died, her beloved Takeru fell into despair!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the afterlife realm <i>Yomi-no-Kuni</i>, she\u2019ll dive into Takeru\u2019s <i>Yume-Sekai</i> (Dream World) and blast away the nightmares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/fa192f850b3c125602d6881486c08384.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/fa192f850b3c125602d6881486c08384.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/fa192f850b3c125602d6881486c08384.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bd To save her owner consumed by nightmares, set off on an adventure in the <i>Yume-Sekai</i> with Lily!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny legs\uff0cbig skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/3f662b3c7208e05eeb65611409b81427.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/3f662b3c7208e05eeb65611409b81427.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/3f662b3c7208e05eeb65611409b81427.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bd Takeru\u2019s precious memories have been stolen by the Petlos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unforgivable\u2026! I\u2019ll take them back no matter what\u2026!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And\u2026 I hope I can see Takeru again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/2409cd8c85372ff05d603916e4c96c45.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/2409cd8c85372ff05d603916e4c96c45.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/2409cd8c85372ff05d603916e4c96c45.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bd A cute dog takes center stage in the world of <i>Yume-Sekai</i>, slashing through nightmares!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fierce battles against the Boss Petlos who stole the memories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/b2b4a136e71bd10a251a934d75fd3b1a.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/b2b4a136e71bd10a251a934d75fd3b1a.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/b2b4a136e71bd10a251a934d75fd3b1a.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/0adb473a89fe4dfe76abe0666ce674a8.poster.avif?t=1755141935\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/0adb473a89fe4dfe76abe0666ce674a8.webm?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/0adb473a89fe4dfe76abe0666ce674a8.mp4?t=1755141935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a heartfelt yet heartwarming canine action story with Lily, set in the slightly dark <i>Yume-Sekai</i> and the fantastical <i>Yomi-no-Kuni</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u25bd\u201cLily in DreamWorld\u201d</i> was selected for the 2025 <i>indie Game incubator (iGi)</i> program, hosted by Marvelous Inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884510/extras/cb54c4150ed9d37d7a27c44db0c81cf6.avif?t=1755141935\" width=1207 height=964 /></span></p>",
